 and fellow olympian  adam rippon  all took to social media to share how  proud they are of simone in her decision  and eti spoke with her former dancing  with the stars pro sasha farber  who didn't hold back his admiration for  simone's unrivaled work ethic  i feel so much love for her she  is such a hard worker and i remember you  know being in the gym with her  we had so much fun but there is just you  know this proves that she's human and  it's so nice to for america to be behind  her and have  she's having all the support because it  is  it must be so much pressure and she's  the star of the team  and simone is clearly feeling the love  the 24 year old gymnast  took to twitter on wednesday to thank  everyone writing  the outpouring love and support i've  received has made me realize  i'm more than my accomplishments and  gymnastics which i never truly believed  [Music]  before

